prompt:
Build a high-precision alpine fintech banking website for "Mercury" adhering strictly to the Mercury Alpine Banking design system with cinematic dark canvas, graphite content cards, single cobalt chromatic action, and interactive state components.

Sections:
1. Header: Fixed transparent navigation bar overlaid on the dark canvas with backdrop-blur. Include the Mercury brand mark with concentric circles on the left, centered nav pill links (Products, Solutions, Treasury, Pricing), a ghost outline "Log in" pill button, the primary Cobalt "Open account" pill button, and a responsive mobile menu toggle using useState.
2. Hero: Full-bleed (100vw) atmospheric mountain photography background with subtle dark overlay. Centered copy stack with 65px headline in arcadiaDisplay weight 480 ("Banking engineered for ambitious founders"), 18px subtitle in Ivory text, and an inline split-pill email capture form using useState (left-pill transparent input with Ivory border + right-pill filled Cobalt "Open account" button).
3. Features: Product capabilities section on Onyx canvas. Implement functional category tab pills with useState to filter between "Treasury & Yield", "Corporate Cards", and "Automated AP/AR". Render 3-column Graphite Cards (#1e1e2a, 12px radius, 32px padding, strictly no drop shadows) displaying line-art glyph icons, 28px headings at weight 480, and 16px body copy in Ivory.
4. Pricing: Account tiers & yield breakdown section. Display 3 flat Graphite Cards ("Standard Checking", "Treasury Pro", "Venture Scale") with an interactive deposit balance toggle or tier switcher using useState that dynamically updates APY earnings (e.g., 5.02% yield) and feature availability.
5. Testimonials: Founder endorsements carousel. Build an elevated Graphite Card featuring verified startup founder quotes, author names, company labels, and star ratings, with functional Previous and Next pill pagination buttons tracking the active slide index using useState.
6. Contact: Private client onboarding and concierge banking inquiry section with direct contact cards and an interactive expandable "Wire Cutoffs & Treasury Operating Hours" disclosure drawer using useState.
7. Footer: Full-width Onyx Canvas footer with FDIC insurance partner disclosure banner (12px text in Ash), grouped links (Products, Resources, Company, Legal), and copyright notice.

Design Constraints & Rules:
- The interface is strictly dark and monochromatic: Onyx Canvas (#171721) background with Graphite (#1e1e2a) cards.
- Cobalt (#5266eb) is the ONLY chromatic color in the entire system, reserved exclusively for the primary 'Open account' action. Never use green, orange, or other accent colors.
- Zero drop shadows across all cards, buttons, and inputs. Elevation is communicated purely through the 1-step value contrast between Onyx and Graphite.
- Pill radius (32px or 40px) for all buttons, inputs, and nav links. Cards must strictly have 12px border radius.
- Headings must use weight 480 (never bold 700+). Primary text is Ivory (#ededf3) and muted text is Ash (#c3c3cc).

